	(text "R_S = (V_S - V_Z) / (I_L + I_Z)\nassume I_L = 0\nI_Z must remain between 67 uA and 15mA.\n\nSet for 5mA\n\nR_S = (-12 - -5) / (5E-3)\n\nR_S ~ 1k4\n\nDamn, E48 exact match. What a day"
